<translation id="1300475218926632111">{COUNT,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Shuttle siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha.}=1{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Shuttle siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Shuttle siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Isibuyekezo esisha se-Shuttle siyatholakala futhi sizosetshenziswa maduze ngemuva kokuthi uqalise kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
<translation id="3667616615096815454">Ayikwazi ukufaka, uhlelo lokusebenza alwaziwa kuseva.</translation>
