<translation id="5274497473086430153">{COUNT,plural, =0{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Shuttle ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo}=1{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Shuttle ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Shuttle ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{Umlawuli wakho ucela ukuthi uqalise kabusha i-Shuttle ukuze kusetshenziswe lesi sibuyekezo. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
