<translation id="9161544906744429402">I-Shuttle ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi okungenzeka uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="3810973564298564668">Phatha</translation>
<translation id="3823384748599722168">Ukuze usebenzise amaphasiwedi akho agciniwe, landela ikhodi ye-QR, dawuniloda iChromium ye-iOS bese ungena ngemvume kuGoogle Account yakho</translation>
<translation id="3846683726093018685">**Fingqa:** Ngomusho owodwa onamagama angaphansi kwa-30, chaza abantu ebhekiswe kubo nenjongo eyinhloko yekhontenti yakho eku-screenshot.

          **Phakamisa Imibuzo:** Sungula uhlu lwamachashazi olunemibuzo emi-3 ukuya kwemi-5 eshukumisa ingqondo engase ibuzwe umsebenzisi ukuze asiqonde kahle i-screenshot. Le mibuzo kufanele ihlanganise okungenani owodwa okhuluma ngokuqondile ngento ebukwayo, indlela eklanywe ngayo, noma indawo ekuyo.</translation>
<translation id="4250996466392346267"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Shuttle</translation>
<translation id="387514319934708384">IChromium idinga imvume yenethiwekhi yendawo kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="3885770153807205175">Okokukhetha ulimi</translation>
<translation id="3870879982795295801">Yenza ngokwezifiso uphinde ulawule i-Shuttle. Okuthile kudinga ukuthi ukunake - chofoza ngemininingwane.</translation>
<translation id="3889543394854987837">Chofoza igama lakho ukuze uvule i-Chromium uphinde uqale ukudlulisa amehlo.</translation>
<translation id="3892148308691398805">Kopisha umbhalo</translation>
<translation id="390528597099634151">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usengene ngemvume kakade kule phrofayela ye-Chromium. Ukuze uqhubeke nokuphequlula ngokwehlukile, i-Chromium ingakwazi ukukudalela iphrofayela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="2803413259281481072">Lesi sandiso sephula inqubomgomo Yesitolo sewebu se-Chrome, futhi kungenzeka singabi esiphephile. Sisuse ku-Shuttle ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lwakho lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="3941890832296813527">Iphutha lokufaka: Igama lefayela lesifaki alivumelekile noma alisekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="3945058413678539331">I-Chromium izama ukukopisha amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="3954172517175569325">Amaphasiwedi akho, izindlela zokukhokha, namakheli owalondoloze kuGoogle Account yakho azosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuChromium, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
<translation id="395904275706073188">Amakhasi avikelwe awakwazi ukufundwa. Zama ikhasi elehlukile.</translation>
<translation id="3962647064319009959">Funda ukuthi i-Chromium ikugcina kanjani uphephile</translation>
<translation id="3967822245660637423">Ukulanda kuqedile</translation>
<translation id="8478344872731892094">Uma uthayipha kubha yekheli noma ebhokisini lokusesha, iShuttle ithumela okuthayiphayo kusesho lwenhlangano yakho, i-AI, nakumathuluzi omenzeli ukuthola iziphakamiso.</translation>
<translation id="3975724895399328945">Mayelana ne-&amp;Google Chrome Yokuhlola</translation>
<translation id="3997429360543082038">Mayelana ne-ChromiumOS</translation>
