<translation id="5294316920224716406">Uma ubhrawuza ngemodi ye-Incognito, i-Chromium izokuxwayisa ngaphambi kokulayisha isayithi isebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile.</translation>
<translation id="5296581118566748922">Sesha ngeChromium</translation>
