<translation id="1764424071909520660">Yehlisa indlela yokusebenza kodwa kwenza iShuttle imelane nakakhulu nokuhlaselwa</translation>
<translation id="5427571867875391349">Setha i-Chromium njengesiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="3552564955884420948"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Shuttle Beta</translation>
<translation id="5460618461609401056">{NUM_TABS,plural, =1{IChromium Incoma Ukumisa Ithebhu Enciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}one{IChromium Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}other{IChromium Incoma Ukumisa Amathebhu Anciphisa Ijubane Lebhrawuza Yakho}}</translation>
<translation id="3837394572112225231">I-Shuttle kungenzeka ingasebenzi ngokufanelekile ngoba ayisasekelwa kule sistimu yokusatshalaliswa kwe-Linux</translation>
<translation id="2864501208955185201">I-Shuttle ivimbele lokhu kudawuniloda ngoba ifayela lingalimaza ama-akhawunti wakho omuntu siqu nawenethiwekhi yokuxhumana nomphakathi</translation>
<translation id="549669000822060376">Sicela ulinde ngenkathi i-Chromium ifaka izibuyekezo zesistimu zakamuva.</translation>
<translation id="5496810170689441661">I-Chromium izama ukuhlela amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="549975168243349205">Sebenza ngaphandle kokuphazamiseka ngama-app akho ayintandokazi njengeGoogle Drive neYouTube usendleleni ngeChromium.</translation>
<translation id="5524890928877629608">ikhona elingaphezulu ngakwesokunxele lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokunxele okungu-<ph name="LEFT" />%, phezulu okungu<ph name="TOP" />%</translation>
<translation id="3510916764590863589">Vula ama-PDF ku-Shuttle</translation>
<translation id="5536164441519929134">Buza<ph name="LINE_BREAK" />mayelana nale thebhu</translation>
<translation id="8317102978607899723">Ukuvikeleka, iShuttle ivala ukulungiselela kweJavaScript uma uvakashela isayithi okokuqala ngqa.

Uma leli khasi lingasebenzi njengoba kulindelekile, zama ukuvumela ukulungiselela.</translation>
<translation id="5575874067957905201">Bonisa iGemini kuChromium kubha yemenyu yeMac bese uvula isinqamuleli sekhibhodi</translation>
<translation id="5576587363991567745">U-<ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> usevele ungene ngemvume. Ukuze ugcine ukubhrawuza kwakho kuhlukile, ngena ngemvume kuChromium kuphrofayela yakho njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" /> Uzophinde uthole ulwazi lwakho olulondoloziwe nokuningi ku-<ph name="DEVICE" />.</translation>
<translation id="5579324208890605088">Iphutha ekuqaliseni: sicela usebenzise isifaki njengomsebenzisi ovamile, hhayi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="5580770360767802657">Sebenzisa iChromium ngokuzenzakalelayo futhi uyenze iphinwe</translation>
<translation id="5596627076506792578">Izinketho eziningi</translation>
<translation id="5605834417512968703">Khetha noma yini ukuze useshe Ngosesho Lomfanekiso noma ucindezele u-escape ukuze uphume Kusesho Lomfanekiso</translation>
<translation id="5618818588972826921">Khetha noma yimuphi umbhalo noma isithombe ukuze useshe Ngosesho Lwezithombe noma cindezela u-escape ukuze uphume Oseshweni Lwezithombe</translation>
<translation id="8908504550344650717">{0,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo se-Shuttle siyatholakala}=1{Isibuyekezo se-Shuttle siyatholakala}one{Isibuyekezo se-Shuttle sitholakala ngezinsuku ezingu-#}other{Isibuyekezo se-Shuttle sitholakala ngezinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="1107298128800350481">Yisule njalo idatha yesayithi kudivayisi yakho lapho uvala i-Shuttle</translation>
<translation id="5653831366781983928">Sicela uqalise kabusha i-Chromium manje</translation>
<translation id="5690427481109656848">I-Google LLC</translation>
<translation id="3675878834104730294">Veza i-Shuttle ngalolu limi</translation>
<translation id="569897634095159764">Ayikwazi ukuxhuma ku-inthanethi Iseva elibamba idinga ukufakazela ubuqiniso.</translation>
<translation id="7168202961287328687">IShuttle ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina iShuttle ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzekela uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesilondolozi Senkumbulo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="5775198138441669627">Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK" /> idatha yeChromium ku-akhawunti yakho</translation>
