<translation id="705851970750939768">Buyekeza i-Chromium</translation>
<translation id="3425455063038300019">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Shuttle izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google.</translation>
